	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_react_enemy_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ジュジュベ『ほほほ
こどもの　あさぢえで▽
なにか　わかると　いうの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ジュジュベ『ほほほ
子供の　浅知恵で▽
何か　わかると　いうの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
